Package: zucrypttest
Title: Consumer Fixture for the zucrypt C API
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not a real package and never published. It exists to prove that
    zucrypt's registered function table can actually be consumed from another
    package's C code: LinkingTo for the headers, Imports plus a real
    importFrom() in NAMESPACE so the namespace is loaded and the C-callable
    is resolvable. It is built and run only by consumer.yaml.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports: 
    zucrypt
LinkingTo: 
    zucrypt
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
